# Disturbed Slumber {1}{G}: "Until end of turn, target land you control becomes a 4/4 Dinosaur creature with reach and haste. It's still
# a land. It must be blocked this turn if able." Bot1's Forest (played turn 1) is the target: Bot2's Forest and Bot1's Mox Emerald (not
# a land) are refused. On turn 3 the Forest becomes a 4/4 Dinosaur land creature with reach and haste and attacks; Bot2 has an
# Ornithopter and a Memnite and must block it with at least one (no block is refused, CR 509.1c): it blocks with the Ornithopter,
# which dies; the Forest takes no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Disturbed Slumber
Plains x3
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Disturbed Slumber.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Forest)
! Bot1.Hand.Disturbed Slumber.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Hand.Disturbed Slumber.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land; Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Dinosaur; Forest
Bot1.Attack(Forest > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Count: 0)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Damage = 0
